.TH CYAML_DICTIONARY_SIZE 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cyaml_dictionary_size \- return the number of keys in a dictionary
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cyaml.h>

size_t cyaml_dictionary_size(cyaml node);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Returns the number of key-value pairs of the CYAML_DICTIONARY node.
The function calls _ccol_fatal_err() when node is NULL and when node
is not of type CYAML_DICTIONARY.
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
The number of keys, which is 0 for an empty dictionary.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cyaml_dictionary_first (3),
.BR cyaml_dictionary_get (3),
.BR cyaml_dictionary_set (3)
